ubscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nabeelvalley/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nabeelvalley","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coat-rack/app/commits/489c70e8787e925782cdc6086f7d226700f19a14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-26T10:11:31Z","email":"36758308+nabeelvalley@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nabeel Valley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-26T10:11:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Ensure consistent handling of spaces (#132)\n\nSpace management/resolution is inconsistent in different parts of the\napp. This standardizes this to be done as follows:\n\n1. Either via the context in logged in contexts\n2. Via the login management screen that manages the context\n\nThis ensures that all parts of the app are able to resolve space and\nuser data in a consistent manner as well as ensure that this data can be\ncleanly passed to the sandbox and internal apps\n\nThis also streamlines some things by storing the entire user data in the\nlocal DB and blocking login until data can be resolved. This is\nunfortunate but ensures that the app is loaded in a ready-to-use state\n\nIn order to improve on this we can also consider storing this \"stash\"\ndata in a synchronous store that will make this data more readily\naccessible","tree":{"sha":"ae770f941f4cf0f5333b4b3b612ce612c19be95d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coat-rack/app/git/trees/ae770f941f4cf0f5333b4b3b612ce612c19be95d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coat-rack/app/git/commits/489c70e8787e925782cdc6086f7d226700f19a14","verification":{"payload":"tree ae770f941f4cf0f5333b4b3b612ce612c19be95d\nparent ea10e46ac4c825a32615d3ef5026d069a55afb68\nparent 0ea4c1851033f08f24062f9ce6031e46840b6e1a\nauthor Nabeel Valley <36758308+nabeelvalley@users.noreply.github.com> 1753524691 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1753524691 +0200\n\nEnsure consistent handling of spaces (#132)\n\nSpace management/resolution is inconsistent in different parts of the\napp. This standardizes this to be done as follows:\n\n1. Either via the context in logged in contexts\n2. Via the login management screen that manages the context\n\nThis ensures that all parts of the app are able to resolve space and\nuser data in a consistent manner as well as ensure that this data can be\ncleanly passed to the sandbox and internal apps\n\nThis also streamlines some things by storing the entire user data in the\nlocal DB and blocking login until data can be resolved. This is\nunfortunate but ensures that the app is loaded in a ready-to-use state\n\nIn order to improve on this we can also consider storing this \"stash\"\ndata in a synchronous store that will make this data more readily\naccessible","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJohKnTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEscQAHbk4C63vcrcF/9UPzZzyB6w\nuxgZJT7WTHgp9LhWvxi/u9/yGQHHTIwe++jfPPBM+bIhxw64zlQSGP4OkPAEXNR+\npqmkpVddwXx5Ty5EtwM+pnpPqLAN16mINM9JlSb3b8FI+dlieuxF6Y080LODyWe5\nnsh+pjhqH9MmXgpS7RW7pX0O2NDRDYnxW4zx1g+NS+v/0bN25EYkeCk6cTSeUlPl\nv/Br7xZIZBcTlxRTF2FrInHLcKyXXO1ToFlPztbsGn5X/gbNG89d/Zh4touTlokW\ntXmyTW+wBz4fdlD+ZqtK2IKNUSF0FIfF2g1imijnCHWCgj06XXWsLEXhIYQqf6dy\nnF68p6NnP5pZVMpSsn0wSv1DwGy4vauIcq4BdWlj9GRCAT4gTYXkBUWh2kv5apqN\neAt8tcd3Z3OhzdGCTHYJLB+xQ9e8bVFAUnnoZsisp6fZoyGgUQwZ1ItBTKhcHgnV\nmLMzwhsVshPP/Y8DS8wPmOVc8O9mHCLZefEIXlJY5jnEC8i7JKJMthD8eDmikFP2\nspSYGUulW5vJnbeYPFOdxUqlITY/ECfevn3yMUhQg+XBxo2MU6vWY+wtbrzIbjaV\nbdU9INCXRakRfpNu5udRj7ranfDfboO298ZAuZ+Kqla8XhKlps08gFJ0LxNYOqW2\nbnOyNn0RUAj1ezF6vN8Y\n=YWt5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-07-26T10:11:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_use