/api.github.com/users/CGuether/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CGuether","id":57527184,"login":"CGuether","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTI3MTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/b4a007d765642f61caa473b629f83c2fdec9d6c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:55:07Z","email":"christian.guether@cumulocity.com","name":"Christian Guether"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:55:07Z","email":"christian.guether@cumulocity.com","name":"Christian Guether"},"message":"feat(agentic-issue-loop): make the agent config change-type aware (bug fix vs feature)\n\nThe loop already handled feature issues at triage level (completeness\ncheck, reproduce exception), but developer and validator wording\nassumed a defect: ''reproduce the bug'', ''the reported behaviour must be\ngone'', and hard-coded fix(<plugin>) commit/PR titles. Feature runs\nwould have produced mislabeled fix(...) PRs and an inverted verify\nstep.\n\n- brief now names the change type and, for features, the current\n  behaviour being changed instead of a root cause\n- developer observes a baseline (repro for bugs, current behaviour for\n  features), verifies acceptance criteria are observable, and commits\n  fix()/feat() to match\n- validator PR title/body follow the change type; body motivates via\n  root cause (bugs) or desired behaviour (features)\n- header documents the scope boundary: one existing plugin or shared,\n  small changes; new packages and cross-plugin features are out of scope\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"663bbc7ac1a6fa93b264fda9e830c66c98a6f5a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/git/trees/663bbc7ac1a6fa93b264fda9e830c66c98a6f5a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/git/commits/b4a007d765642f61caa473b629f83c2fdec9d6c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57527184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CGuether","id":57527184,"login":"CGuether","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTI3MTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commit/b4a007d765642f61caa473b629f83c2fdec9d6c8","node_id":"C_kwDOLLAFgdoAKGI0YTAwN2Q3NjU2NDJmNjFjYWE0NzNiNjI5ZjgzYzJmZGVjOWQ2Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commit/d16f128ed7d5e7996dd2b326b5ad544d1cf1655a","sha":"d16f128ed7d5e7996dd2b326b5ad544d1cf1655a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/d16f128ed7d5e7996dd2b326b5ad544d1cf1655a"}],"sha":"b4a007d765642f61caa473b629f83c2fdec9d6c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/b4a007d765642f61caa473b629f83c2fdec9d6c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57527184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CGuether","id":57527184,"login":"CGuether","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTI3MTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/d16f128ed7d5e7996dd2b326b5ad544d1cf1655a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:55:24Z","email":"christian.guether@cumulocity.com","name":"Christian Guether"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:55:24Z","email":"christian.guether@cumulocity.com","name":"Christian Guether"},"message":"fix(agentic-issue-loop): survive iteration-hungry runs and report silent guardrail stops\n\nRun for issue #89 died silently: root hit max_iterations 50 before ever\ndelegating (compile-wait polling and browser steps each burn a model\nturn), and a max_iterations stop in docker-agent --exec (v1.127.0)\nexits 0 with NO transcript event — so the report step, grepping for\nevent names, never fired and the issue went stale after \"processing\nstarted\".\n\n- raise max_iterations to 150 for all three agents; the cost/time\n  budgets remain the real spend backstop\n- instruct all agents to wait for the dev-server compile with ONE\n  blocking shell call instead of a poll per turn (also avoids the\n  max_consecutive_tool_calls identical-call guard)\n- workflow: detect premature ends from the ISSUE''s label state (a\n  finished run always leaves exactly one agent:* outcome label) instead\n  of transcript event names; transcript/step outcome only refine the\n  stated reason\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b0bb799c8b7609f2f58047e1080744386d4ea14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/git/trees/1b0bb799c8b7609f2f58047e1080744386d4ea14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/git/commits/d16f128ed7d5e7996dd2b326b5ad544d1cf1655a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57527184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CGuether","id":57527184,"login":"CGuether","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTI3MTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commit/d16f128ed7d5e7996dd2b326b5ad544d1cf1655a","node_id":"C_kwDOLLAFgdoAKGQxNmYxMjhlZDdkNWU3OTk2ZGQyYjMyNmI1YWQ1NDRkMWNmMTY1NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commit/c581b79068ca583d8e223475a8e8d73b11b8f0ff","sha":"c581b79068ca583d8e223475a8e8d73b11b8f0ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/c581b79068ca583d8e223475a8e8d73b11b8f0ff"}],"sha":"d16f128ed7d5e7996dd2b326b5ad544d1cf1655a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/d16f128ed7d5e7996dd2b326b5ad544d1cf1655a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57527184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CGuether","id":57527184,"login":"CGuether","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTI3MTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/c581b79068ca583d8e223475a8e8d73b11b8f0ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T12:17:01Z","email":"christian.guether@cumulocity.com","name":"Christian Guether"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T12:17:01Z","email":"christian.guether@cumulocity.com","name":"Christian Guether"},"message":"fix(agentic-issue-loop): run the agent job in the e2e environment\n\nThe Cumulocity tenant config (C8Y_BASEURL/C8Y_TENANT/C8Y_USERNAME\nvariables and the C8Y_PASSWORD secret) is scoped to the ''e2e'' GitHub\nenvironment, but the job never declared it, so all four resolved to\nempty strings: .env got empty values, the playwright secrets file was\nblank, and `ng serve` crashed on its empty -u proxy target — every\nagent run failed e2e validation with an environment blocker.\n\nThe e2e environment has no protection rules, so declaring it adds no\napproval gate. Header comment updated to document the scoping.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f8dc5893a1454029cf86ec24b6ebca8901dda5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/git/trees/3f8dc5893a1454029cf86ec24b6ebca8901dda5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/git/commits/c581b79068ca583d8e223475a8e8d73b11b8f0ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57527184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CGuether","id":57527184,"login":"CGuether","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTI3MTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commit/c581b79068ca583d8e223475a8e8d73b11b8f0ff","node_id":"C_kwDOLLAFgdoAKGM1ODFiNzkwNjhjYTU4M2Q4ZTIyMzQ3NWE4ZThkNzNiMTFiOGYwZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commit/6d77e49548869688bc66173bf020a085cd57eacc","sha":"6d77e49548869688bc66173bf020a085cd57eacc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/6d77e49548869688bc66173bf020a085cd57eacc"}],"sha":"c581b79068ca583d8e223475a8e8d73b11b8f0ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/c581b79068ca583d8e223475a8e8d73b11b8f0ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57527184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CGuether","id":57527184,"login":"CGuether","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTI3MTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/6d77e49548869688bc66173bf020a085cd57eacc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:46:26Z","email":"christian.guether@cumulocity.com","name":"Christian Guether"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:46:26Z","email":"christian.guether@cumulocity.com","name":"Christian Guether"},"message":"fix(agentic-issue-loop): repair MCP tool permissions and surface docker-agent crashes\n\n- issue-loop.yaml: the allow patterns \"mcp:<server>:*\" are not valid\n  docker-agent syntax and matched nothing, so --safety restricted denied\n  every MCP call (github_*, playwright_*, c8y_sdk_*). MCP tools are\n  matched by their qualified tool names — use those globs instead.\n- workflow: set -o pipefail in the agent-loop step so a docker-agent\n  crash is no longer swallowed by the tee pipeline and fails the job.\n- workflow: the report step now also comments on the issue and applies\n  the agent:failed label when the agent-loop step failed outright\n  (e.g. a model/provider error), detected via the step outcome since\n  the error line goes to stderr and never reaches the transcript.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0b2ff8abc74261e2cd1576b29885ad77ac84607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/git/trees/c0b2ff8abc74261e2cd1576b29885ad77ac84607"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/git/commits/6d77e49548869688bc66173bf020a085cd57eacc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57527184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CGuether","id":57527184,"login":"CGuether","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTI3MTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commit/6d77e49548869688bc66173bf020a085cd57eacc","node_id":"C_kwDOLLAFgdoAKDZkNzdlNDk1NDg4Njk2ODhiYzY2MTczYmYwMjBhMDg1Y2Q1N2VhY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commit/6ea433350df63a7763c6a67226fc7d985e269fe0","sha":"6ea433350df63a7763c6a67226fc7d985e269fe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/6ea433350df63a7763c6a67226fc7d985e269fe0"}],"sha":"6d77e49548869688bc66173bf020a085cd57eacc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cumulocity-IoT/cumulocity-ui-toolkit/commits/6d77e49548869688bc66173bf020a085cd57eacc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57527184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CGuether","id":57527184,"login":"CGuether","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTI3MTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CGuether","user_view_type":"public